# Performance

- Public pages ship no admin or driver code: keep `@dnd-kit` and map code in `/driver` route chunks only (TanStack code-splits per route; do not import them from shared files).
- Fonts: self-hosted, `latin` subset only where possible; no third-party font CDNs.
- Images: serve ≤ 200 KB, `loading="lazy"` below the fold, explicit aspect ratio to avoid layout shift.
- New dependency: justify bundle cost (the Stripe SDK is deliberately avoided: plain `fetch` + one HMAC check).
- Measure with Lighthouse on a deployed preview before launch (`docs/PREDEPLOY_CHECKLIST.md`).
